{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>深水埗運動場有地盤發現兩枚懷疑戰時炸彈。</p><p></p><p>身穿保護裝備的爆炸品處理課人員，到場處理。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.BOMB-2000_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20261AinRIuAw71795789880.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>警方傍晚6時接獲工人報案，指深水埗運動場內一個籃球場地盤，發現兩枚懷疑戰時炸彈，體積大約5厘米乘2厘米，附近約15米範圍需要圍封。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.BOMB-2000.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Trt5MHa4iJ1795790086.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T15:23:53.325703+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T14:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T15:17:15.933498+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T15:17:15.933498+00:00","content_hash":"818e76fc281df60ffc877feb1e2b0a50659b87cfe1e1e6e6f83d678ba88a9426","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}